  {
   "id": 5,
   "narration": "[[1]]实际计算时都用分量式。质量离散分布的物系，x_C 等于 Σ m_i x_i 除以 m 撇，y、z 方向同理。[[2]]质量连续分布的物体，求和就变成积分：x_C 等于 m 撇分之一乘上 x 对 dm 的积分。[[3]]还有一个能省掉大半工作的结论：对密度均匀、形状对称的物体，质心就在它的几何中心。",
   "elements": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "step": 0,
     "x": 170,
     "y": 137,
     "w": 1580,
     "h": 90,
     "align": "left",
     "valign": "center",
     "paras": [
      [
       {
        "t": "2　质心的位置　分量式",
        "size": 52,
        "color": "#C00000",
        "b": true
       }
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "step": 1,
     "x": 170,
     "y": 240,
     "w": 1580,
     "h": 100,
     "align": "center",
     "valign": "center",
     "paras": [
      [
       {
        "t": "质量离散分布：",
        "size": 42,
        "color": "#0000CD",
        "b": true
       }
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "tex",
     "step": 1,
     "x": 170,
     "y": 352,
     "w": 1580,
     "h": 185,
     "tex": "x_C=\\dfrac{\\sum\\limits_i m_ix_i}{m'},\\qquad y_C=\\dfrac{\\sum\\limits_i m_iy_i}{m'},\\qquad z_C=\\dfrac{\\sum\\limits_i m_iz_i}{m'}",
     "size": 36,
     "color": "#111111",
     "align": "center"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
