   "heading": "例4　求质心高度"
  },
  {
   "id": 19,
   "narration": "[[1]]把 y_C 代进质心运动定理：F 减 λyg 等于 lλ 乘上 y_C 对时间的二阶导。[[2]]而 y_C 是 y 平方除以二 l，对时间求两次导，要用乘积的导数法则。[[3]]结果等于 l 分之一乘上 dy/dt 的平方，加上 y 乘 d²y/dt²。[[4]]匀速上提，dy/dt 就是 v，而 d²y/dt² 等于零，后一项消失。[[5]]所以 F 等于 λyg 加 λv 平方。两项的意义很清楚：前一项撑住已提起那段的重量，后一项是把地面链节从静止加速到 v 所必需的力——所以提得越快，手越吃力。",
   "elements": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "step": 0,
     "x": 170,
     "y": 137,
     "w": 1500,
     "h": 90,
     "align": "left",
     "valign": "center",
     "paras": [
      [
       {
        "t": "例4　结果",
        "size": 52,
        "color": "#C00000",
        "b": true
       }
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "tex",
     "step": 1,
     "x": 320,
     "y": 234,
     "w": 1280,
     "h": 175,
     "tex": "F-\\lambda yg=l\\lambda\\dfrac{\\mathrm d^2y_C}{\\mathrm dt^2}",
     "size": 42,
     "color": "#111111",
     "align": "center"
    },
    {
     "type": "tex",
     "step": 2,
     "x": 300,
     "y": 428,
     "w": 1320,
     "h": 205,
     "tex": "\\dfrac{\\mathrm d^2y_C}{\\mathrm dt^2}=\\dfrac{1}{l}\\left[\\left(\\dfrac{\\mathrm dy}{\\mathrm dt}\\right)^2+y\\dfrac{\\mathrm d^2y}{\\mathrm dt^2}\\right]",
     "size": 34,
     "color": "#111111",
     "align": "center"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "step": 3,
     "x": 170,
     "y": 656,
     "w": 1580,
     "h": 110,
     "align": "left",
     "valign": "center",
     "paras": [
      [
